OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric Dunoon venue facing
OL,4,Aclosure due to soaring running costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff were informed of the news this
OL,7,Fmorning. The hall employs a total of 11
OL,8,Fpeople in a variety of part-time roles,
OL,9,Fsupported by volunteers.
